    bathrooms: 6,
    max_guests: 15,
    has_pool: true,
    description: `Villa BluDoor has been honoured with the prestigious ‘Villa of the Year 2024’ award at MMT India’s Favourite Homestays Awards!   It is a sanctuary of refined luxury amidst picturesque beaches & chic dining spots in Assagao, Goa. This exquisite pet-friendly 5-BHK villa seamlessly blends contemporary comfort with timeless style, offering an unparalleled retreat.   Its blue doorway exudes cool sea vibes, & it is surrounded by sprawling gardens filled with unique flora, creating a harmonious & serene ambience. Step inside to find a sparkling private pool area adorned with an exquisite gazebo & lush greenery, inviting guests to unwind in an oasis of tranquillity.   The living space emanates elegance with its classic furniture, intricate wall designs, & stylish decor, establishing a vibrant yet refined atmosphere.    The dining area, featuring a grand table, tasteful lighting, & artistic touches, provides an inviting ambience for memorable gatherings. The sleek, lavish turquoise kitchen, exquisitely designed with high-end finishes & premium appliances, is perfect for culinary mastery.    The media room offers ultimate relaxation & entertainment featuring stylish furniture & a large TV—ideal for binge-watching shows or enjoying a movie night. Each bedroom is a masterpiece, with unique decor & a touch of luxury, offering modern comforts.     The glass house is a standout feature, with stunning glass windows that offer scenic views of the surrounding landscape. This unique space allows guests to work or relax while taking in the beauty of nature, blending indoor comfort with outdoor serenity.    The rooftop entertainment room is equipped with foosball & pool tables, along with a bar counter. This space is perfect for socialising & enjoying leisure activities with family & friends. The villa is equipped with a private lift, ensuring exclusive & seamless accessibility.   Rooted in the ethos of "Atithi Devo Bhava," a top 5-star hospitality team is committed to ensuring every guest is pampered with exceptional care and attention.     Bedrooms   Bedroom 1 - The Notebook  This ground-floor bedroom offers a king-sized poster bed, an ensuite bathroom, a vintage workstation, elegant murals, and a private balcony, combining luxury and comfort in a serene setting.     Bedroom 2 - Blue Valentine  This tranquil bedroom features a king-sized bed, elegant wall moulding, and a monochromatic deep blue colour scheme, all complemented by a cosy seating area and warm lighting.     Bedroom 3 - Seaside Letters An elegant bedroom with an ensuite bathroom boasting a stunning blue arched wall with a hand-painted motif, a vintage-style workstation, and a private balcony overlooking a pool and garden.     Bedroom 4 - Green Gables With soothing sage green walls and a striking patterned tile floor, this thoughtfully designed bedroom features two single beds and a vintage-style chair for a cozy, restful stay.     Bedroom 5 - The Blush Affair This enchanting bedroom combines architectural interest from its beamed, vaulted ceiling with a delicate pink color palette and a vibrant rattan headboard     Ensuite bathrooms Shower, geyser, and hand bidet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western-style commode     Midnight in Mandarin This captivating living lounge is defined by a hand-painted wall mural and furnished with a plush sofa set and elegant antique pieces, all complemented by a stunning chandelier and dual AC units.       Tangerine Tales A vibrant first-floor retreat with bold terracotta walls, cosy furnishings, curated décor, and all the essentials for relaxed movie nights, reading, or simply unwinding in style.     The Mintrix A spacious, well-lit retreat on the second floor, featuring exposed wooden beams, foosball and pool tables, a stylish bar and modern décor, the perfect setting for fun, relaxation, and entertaining.      Golden Hour Grove Adorned with exposed wooden beams and expansive glass panels, this third-floor patio offers panoramic views and a terracotta roof. The space is elegantly furnished with a lounge sofa, a natural wood table, and a bar corner.     Toast to Love This spacious blue-tone kitchen offers ample storage and modern appliances, blending style and function for an effortless cooking experience.     Dining – The Emerald Feast Defined by a stately wooden table and a plush emerald banquette, this dining space sits beneath a magnificent chandelier and is appointed with timeless elegance.     Garde - The Secret Bloom A well-maintained garden is an outdoor oasis featuring a bar counter and a variety of flora and fauna, all located just steps from the swimming pool.     Private pool - The Blue Lagoon Tucked amidst lush, manicured lawns and vibrant greenery, this private outdoor pool offers an exclusive escape, complete with a poolside gazebo and a refreshing outdoor shower.`,
