    bedrooms: 4,
    bathrooms: 4,
    max_guests: 10,
    has_pool: true,
    description: `Say hello to Tropical in the heart of Cloud7, Vagator's hidden retreat in North Goa. Step inside and you'll be greeted by this roomy living room with sky-high ceilings. Right outside? A big pool waiting just for you. Feeling beachy? Ozran is just a 5-minute drive away. And when it's time to eat, you've got great places like Soro, Titlie, Purple Martini, Pisco by the beach and Antares only 10 minutes out. Oh, and a fun fact: Tropical is among the seven spacious villas in the Cloud7 collection, making it perfect for hosting big gatherings. Exciting, right?     Inside Villa Room 1: On the ground floor, it’s spacious with that king-sized bed. Slide open the balcony doors, and you've got the forest serenading you.   Room 2 & Room 3: Upstairs magic. Both rooms rock those plush king-sized beds. But Room 2? It has a balcony with a forest view that feels like pure therapy.   Room 4: Also upstairs, equipped with—yes, you guessed it—another luxurious king-sized bed.   Living Room: Downstairs is where it's at. Comfy sofas, Double height roof with chandelier, a laid-back ambiance, and direct access to the pool. Perfect spot for both daydreaming and night planning.   Dining Room: Adjacent to the living space. A six-seater dining table ready for feasts, fun, and maybe a board game or two.   Swimming Pool: This is where the magic happens. Dive into the large pool.   Kitchen: Our kitchen? It’s got all the good stuff from Hafele. A big concealed fridge for all your snacks and drinks, a gas stove for when you're in the mood to cook, an OTG for baking and cravings and of course a concealed dishwasher. And for the finishing touches, a range of cutlery is at your disposal to plate up those delightful creations.`,
