    has_pool: true,
    description: `Set against the backdrop of a serene resort, this beautifully appointed 1-room retreat captures the essence of relaxation with stylish interiors and a peaceful ambiance.   Thoughtfully crafted for couples or solo travellers, this space features elegant interiors and a private bathtub — ideal for those seeking a bit of indulgence on their Goan escape.   Just a short distance from the shoreline, you’ll find Ashwem Beach only 1.2 km away and Morjim Beach just 1.6 km from the property. Whether you prefer a lazy beach day or sunset strolls by the sea, North Goa’s scenic coastline is right at your doorstep.   The resort itself offers plenty of ways to unwind. Lounge on the sunbeds with your favourite book in hand. When hunger strikes, head to the on-site garden restaurant set amidst lush greenery. With its charming hut-style cabanas and relaxed outdoor seating, it’s a great place to enjoy delicious meals and relaxed conversations.   As the sun sets, sip a cocktail at the chic bar with open views and a calming breeze. And if you're in the mood to explore Goa’s buzzing nightlife, you’re in luck — popular hotspots like La Plage, Farzi Beach, Saz by the Beach, and antiSOCIAL are just a short walk away.   Relaxation or exploration — whatever your mood, this stay places you in the perfect spot to enjoy both. Rooted in the ethos of "Atithi Devo Bhava," a top 5-star hospitality team is committed to ensuring every guest is pampered with exceptional care and attention.   Note:  The Resort features beautifully designed rooms with attached balconies/patios spread across different floors. Room allocation is subject to availability at the time of booking.   Also, if you're travelling with your furry companions, please check availability in advance, as some of our retreats are pet-friendly.     Bedroom One King-Sized Bed | Ensuite Bathroom | 145 sq. ft | 42” TV | AC & Fan | Mini Fridge | Electric Kettle | Chair & Mirror | Warm Lighting | Wardrobe Space | Attached Balcony/Patio with Seating   Bathroom Bathtub | Shower, Geyser & Hand Bidet Spray | Hair Dryer | Organic Toiletries & Towels | Western Commode     Restaurant Beautiful hut-style cabanas with seating | Seating capacity: 40 guests | Lush greenery all around | Ambient night lamps | A chic bar with stools and scenic views`,
