    has_pool: false,
    description: `Presenting Indah, a 4-bedroom villa equipped for both comfort and convenience. If you're planning a trip with family or a small group of friends, Indah has you covered. You'll have your own private pool and a garden for outdoor moments. Each bedroom comes with air conditioning and its own bathroom, ensuring a private and comfortable stay. And if you’re looking to watch a movie or two, there’s a dedicated TV room in the attic.   Inside Indah As you walk into Indah, you'll find a spacious layout that can comfortably accommodate up to 8 guests. The villa has four bedrooms, and each one has a double bed, a wardrobe, and its own bathroom. If you need extra mattresses, just let us know, and we'll sort it out for you. The living room on the ground floor connects to the dining area and kitchen, making it convenient for meals and social gatherings. If you're in the mood for a movie, head up to the attic. There's a soundproof TV room up there, complete with a home theater system and an adjoining washroom. For those who prefer spending time outdoors, the top three bedrooms have balconies that provide easy access to the pool via wooden stairs.   Access Guide When you book a stay at Indah, you get to use the whole villa. That means all four bedrooms, the living room, the TV room, the pool, and the garden are exclusively yours. There’s also parking space available, should you need it.   Other Services At ELIVAAS, we're all about enhancing your stay. Our concierge service is ready to arrange vehicle rentals, connect you with a local tour guide, secure restaurant reservations, and even book local adventures for you.   Security Deposit A Refundable Security Deposit of INR 10,000 will be collected before check-in and will be refunded within 3 to 5 working days of check-out, if there will be no damages found.`,
