    has_pool: true,
    description: `Tucked away in the picturesque village of Assagao, this stunning 4-BHK villa redefines the concept of leisure living. Situated in a secure, gated area, this villa is perfect for intimate events—whether it’s a small wedding, a birthday celebration, or any occasion that calls for something special.   Inside, the grand living area exudes contemporary aesthetics, with plush deep-blue sofas, patterned flooring, and floor-to-ceiling windows that bathe the space in natural light, blending with the outdoor area just steps away. A stylish bar area sits ready for evening gatherings, and the dining space nearby offers the perfect setting for enjoying meals.   Each bedroom has its own distinctive style, featuring king-sized beds and ensuite bathrooms that promise comfort with every touch. Outside, the pool area steals the spotlight—lounge by the sparkling water, enjoy the outdoor shower, or relax in the jacuzzi under the stars. The space is completed by a charming gazebo, offering the perfect spot to relax, with warm lights casting a soft glow over the deck in the evening.   Cosmopolitan in nature, Assagao’s charm shines through its artistic cafes, and restaurants like Mojigao, Bawri, Gunpowder, and Avo's Kitchen—each just a short distance from the villa.   Complementing this experience is the dedicated 5-star hospitality team, embodying the spirit of "Atithi Devo Bhava." From a butler and chef-on-call to a well-stocked fridge and a premium welcome basket, every detail is thoughtfully arranged to make guests feel cared for and pampered!   Bedrooms   Bedroom-1  Crystal Cove A stylish first-floor suite featuring a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, cosy sofa chairs, and a private balcony with seating.    Bathroom-1 Enjoy a relaxing soak in the bathtub, with plush towels, a hairdryer, and organic toiletries.     Bedroom-2  Mirage Suite Perched on the first floor, this suite offers a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, and a private balcony with seating.   Bathroom-2 Fitted with a shower complemented by premium organic toiletries, towels, and a hairdryer.     Bedrooms-3   Azure Retreat An elegant ground-floor retreat with a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, and stylish seating with pool access.   Bathroom-3 This bathroom has a shower, organic toiletries, and plush towels.     Bedroom- 4 Silver Reef Located on the first floor, this bedroom combines comfort and style with a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, and a chic seating area.   Bathroom-4 Equipped with a shower, a hairdryer, and premium organic toiletries.     The Regency Hall  The exquisite living area features classy furnishings, large windows, a stylish bar counter and a convenient powder room.     Dining Delight The kitchen offers modern appliances like a microwave, air fryer, and refrigerator, while the elegant eight-seater dining table is conveniently placed near the living room.     Aqua Bay Take a refreshing dip in the private pool, enjoy the convenience of an outdoor shower, or relax in the soothing jacuzzi, all set against a charming poolside gazebo.`,
