    max_guests: 12,
    has_pool: true,
    description: `Tucked away in the countryside of the Pink City, this exquisite 3-BHK villa strikes the perfect balance between grandeur and comfort, offering a serene retreat amidst the Aravalli hills!   Set amidst 27,000 sq. ft. of lush greenery, the villa is surrounded by a beautiful garden, featuring a delightful gazebo that provides an ideal setting for morning coffee or cosy bonfire evenings beneath a starry sky.   Enjoy a refreshing swim in the crystal-clear pool, bordered by a wooden deck with comfortable loungers and ambient lighting. A striking feature wall, decorated with detailed white lattice and serene stone sculptures, adds to the enchanting ambiance. Just beyond the pool, a shaded pergola with seating offers a calm retreat to relax and enjoy nature.   The living room is designed with a grand curved olive-green sofa, encircling a chic white and gold coffee table, creating a cosy lounging space. Towering floor-to-ceiling windows flood the space with natural light, highlighting the intricate wall patterns and a regal chandelier overhead.   Each bedroom offers its distinctive charm with elegant decor and spacious ensuite bathrooms. One features a unique round bed, a private balcony, and a luxurious bathtub for ultimate relaxation. Another is designed for comfort with twin beds and a cosy window nook, making it an inviting space to unwind. The third bedroom, overlooking the garden, boasts a plush king-sized bed and a Victorian balloon chair.   The fully equipped kitchen has modern appliances and a stylish island with seating, ensuring every culinary need is met. Gather at the chic dining table, illuminated by unique light fixtures, and enjoy delicious meals with the convenience of direct pool access.   For alfresco gatherings, the villa boasts an outdoor kitchen with a large white stone counter, built-in sink, a grill, and a cooking station—perfect for leisurely brunches.    Inspired by the tradition of  Atithi Devo Bhava , a distinguished 5-star hospitality team is committed to providing guests with exceptional service and thoughtful care.   Please note that no stag groups are permitted .   Bedrooms   Bedroom 1 One round bed | Ensuite bathroom | 225 sq.ft | AC | Fan | Heater | Wardrobe space | Swing chair | Sofa chairs | Attached balcony with seating | Elegant light fixtures | Hill view | Located on the first floor   Bathroom 1 Bathtub | Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Hair dryer | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode     Bedroom 2 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 225 sq.ft | AC | Fan | Heater | Window bed | Victorian balloon chair | Window bed | Wardrobe space | Garden view | Located on the ground floor   Bathroom 2 Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Hair dryer | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode     Bedroom 3 Twin beds | Ensuite bathroom | 225 sq.ft | AC | Fan | Heater | Window bed | Elegant light fixtures | Wardrobe space | Garden view | Located on the first floor   Bathroom 3 Shower, geyser, and hand jet spray | Hair dryer | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode     Living Room 400 sq.ft | Semi-circular sofa and a centre table | AC | 55” TV | Music system | Chandelier | Powder room | Located on the ground floor     Kitchen Ample storage space | Fully equipped with all the necessary appliances like refrigerator, oven, microwave, gas cooktop, toaster, water purifier/RO, mixer/grinder, kettle, crockery and cutlery | Kitchen island with seating | Located on the ground floor     Dining An 8-seater dining table near the living room | Unique light fixtures | Pool access | Located on the ground floor     Outdoor kitchen Spacious white stone countertop | Built-in sink and grill | Cooking station     Garden Expansive lush garden | Gazebo with seating | Hill view     Outdoor pool Private pool | 4 ft | Outdoor shower | Loungers | Poolside gazebo with seating`,
