    description: `Just a five-minute drive from the famous Bhushi Dam, this magnificent 4-BHK villa is a true architectural gem, nestled against rolling hills and vast greenery. Suitable for large groups, it offers ample space to relax while ensuring privacy for every guest.   Echoing a modern minimalist aesthetic, the dual-level villa features a striking glass facade, earthy tones, and a lush green exterior wall. Inside, the living room stuns with a soaring double-height ceiling, pristine white interiors, and sophisticated furnishings that exude timeless elegance. An exquisite statement chandelier exudes grandeur, while a bold geometric console table serves as a stylish centerpiece.    At the heart of the outdoor space lies a grand swimming pool, accentuated by a cascading water feature. Surrounding it is a stylish sun deck furnished with plush loungers, patio umbrellas, and an alfresco dining setup—perfect for brunches or enchanting candlelit dinners. A unique sunken seating pit offers a cosy haven for leisurely evenings under starlit skies.   A beautiful sculptural gazebo, crafted with slender metal beams, stands as a striking architectural focal point in the garden. Artistic outdoor accents, including a striking black horse sculpture, further elevate the villa’s tranquil charm.   Each of the four elegantly designed bedrooms features an attached patio on the ground floor and a private balcony on the first floor—one of which boasts a luxurious bathtub. Glass walls in the first-floor bedrooms frame uninterrupted views of the surrounding hills. Cosy seating makes these outdoor nooks ideal for a quiet morning coffee, while the extended ceilings provide ample shade and comfort.    To elevate this experience, a dedicated 5-star hospitality team is always on hand, ready to assist with a warm smile and genuine care, embodying the true essence of "Atithi Devo Bhava." From a butler and chef-on-call to a well-stocked fridge and a premium welcome basket, every detail is thoughtfully arranged to make guests feel cared for and pampered!     Aqua Bay Dive into the grand swimming pool, complemented by a cascading water feature, a stylish deck with loungers, elegant patio umbrellas, and an alfresco dining space.      Outdoor Serenity  Designed with sleek metal beams, the beautiful gazebo stands out in the lush garden, alongside a unique sunken seating pit. Artistic accents like a striking black horse sculpture add to the villa's charm.     Bedrooms   Bedroom 1 Monochrome Haven This stylish ground-floor suite offers ultimate comfort with a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, floor-to-ceiling glass windows, a striped lounge chair, and a spacious patio with seating.   Bathroom 1  The bathroom includes a bathtub, shower, hairdryer, towels and premium organic toiletries.     Bedroom 2 The Skyframe Nest  A stylish first-floor room featuring a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, floor-to-ceiling glass windows, and a private balcony with serene hill views.   Bathroom 2 Fitted with a shower, organic toiletries, and plush towels.     Bedroom 3 The Dune Retreat This ground-floor room features a king-sized bed, an ensuite bathroom, and floor-to-ceiling windows that open up to a spacious patio with seating, a fan, and lamps.   Bathroom 3 Includes a shower, premium organic toiletries, towels, and a hairdryer.     Bedroom 4 Ivory & Ash A cosy ground-floor suite with a king-sized bed, ensuite bathroom, large windows, and a spacious patio with seating—offering pool view and direct access.   Bathroom 4 Equipped with a shower, a hairdryer, and premium organic toiletries.     The Lumière Pavilion  The elegant double-height living room features chic sofas, floor-to-ceiling windows, a sleek entertainment unit, and a statement chandelier, with a powder room close by.     Dining Delight  The kitchen features modern appliances including a microwave, induction cooktop, refrigerator, kettle and toaster. The stylish eight-seater dining table is perfectly positioned near the living room, complete with an AC and pool access.     Experiences & Enhancements Hookah/Sheesha for a relaxed social vibe  (chargeable) Professional photoshoot sessions  (chargeable) BBQ counter  (chargeable) Bonfire gatherings  (chargeable) Sundowner setups  (chargeable) Floating breakfast basket  (chargeable) Curated private celebrations  (birthdays, anniversaries, bachelorette, etc. — chargeable) Poolside entertainment with outdoor games & live screenings  (chargeable)`,
