    has_pool: false,
    description: `Just a 15-minute drive from the sacred Triveni Ghat, this charming pet-friendly 4-BHK penthouse with soundproof rooms in Rishikesh offers the perfect escape for those seeking serenity and comfort!   Step into a living room that exudes warmth and elegance, thoughtfully designed with plush Chesterfield sofas, rich wooden paneling, golden accents, and a striking chandelier. Floor-to-ceiling windows and an attached balcony bathe the room in natural light, creating an inviting ambiance for gatherings. A stylish entertainment unit, complete with a built-in bookshelf, and curated decor, adds to the charm.   Unwind with handcrafted drinks at the chic indoor bar, featuring a sleek black marble countertop beautifully contrasted against warm wooden textures. High-back bar stools with brass-stud detailing lend a vintage touch, while a vibrant painting brings character to the space.   Each of the four elegantly designed bedrooms features king-sized beds and modern amenities, offering both privacy and convenience. One of the bathrooms features a luxurious bathtub, while three bedrooms extend to private balconies, offering breathtaking views of the surrounding landscape.   The well-equipped kitchen seamlessly extends into the dining area, where an eight-seater table, high-back chairs, and soft pendant lighting create the perfect setting for delicious meals.   Rooted in the ethos of "Atithi Devo Bhava," a top 5-star hospitality team is committed to ensuring every guest is pampered with exceptional care and attention.     Bedrooms   Bedroom 1 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 264 sq.ft | AC | Fan | Wardrobe space | Chairs and a centre table | Attached balcony with seating | Located on the sixth floor   Bathroom 1 Bathtub | Shower, geyser and hand bidet spray | Hair dryer | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode     Bedroom 2 One king-sized bed | Common bathroom | 221 sq.ft | AC | Fan | 42” TV | Chandelier | Wardrobe space | Attached balcony with seating | Hill views | Located on the sixth floor   Bathroom 2 Shower, geyser and hand bidet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode     Bedroom 3 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 220 sq.ft | AC | Fan | 42” TV | Wardrobe space | Attached balcony with seating | Hill views | Located on the sixth floor   Bathroom 3 Shower, geyser and hand bidet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode     Bedroom 4 One king-sized bed | Ensuite bathroom | 220 sq.ft | AC | Fan | 42” TV | Wardrobe space | Located on the sixth floor   Bathroom 4 Shower, geyser and hand bidet spray | Organic toiletries and towels | Western commode     Living room 512 sq.ft | Chesterfield sofas & a centre table | 43” TV | Music system | AC | Fans | Chandeliers | Floor-to-ceiling windows | Built-in wooden bookshelf | Attached balcony with seating | Located on the sixth floor     Indoor bar Sleek bar counter | High-back bar stools | Wooden cabinetry | Warm lighting | Located on the sixth floor     Kitchen Ample storage space | Fully equipped with all the necessary appliances like refrigerator, microwave, gas cooktop, toaster, mixer/grinder, kettle, water purifier/ RO, crockery and cutlery | Fan | Located on the sixth floor     Dining An 8-seater dining table near the living room | AC | Fan | Pendant lamps | Located on the sixth floor`,
